/* by welcometorapture and Marintho for Stronghold Frenzy 2, made in August 2025
if the wonder dies u die
changelog 
03/09/2025
-gave players stronger citywalls to discourage douching and vill rushing
-additional wonders can no longer be created
-wonders have +1K hp
-city walls have +3 melee armor
-wonders are less costly to repair
-there is unbuildable terrain outside the wonder base
16/02/2026
added a toggle for city walls or normal walls on the wonder base
 */

<PLAYER_SETUP>
behavior_version 1
random_placement
